<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<rdf:RDF
   xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
   xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
   xmlns:thalabus="https://thalabus.io/ontology/"
>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_7de9a6a414e0">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_7de9a6a414e0</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>SOCIAL_WELFARE_INSTRUMENT</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Category for documents proposing or discussing specific social welfare instruments, such as supplementary benefits, subsidies, or financial support programs designed to alleviate poverty or support vulnerable groups.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_0c688bd1c1ce">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_0c688bd1c1ce</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>URBAN_DEVELOPMENT_PROJECT</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Documents related to urban planning initiatives, including residential construction, densification strategies, zoning changes, and integration with municipal development plans.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/EntityOntology/Parlament/Topic">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Topic</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>EntityOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>03b83a60-becb-4e4e-af82-ca657a17de0c</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>Topic</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>A subject topic from the solution-owned topic scheme (T10 hybrid, Tier 2). Seeded from the measured draft F5: 32 seeds over one broader level, 52.8 % floor coverage of all affairs (streamed over 326,123 affairs); expansion toward 40-60 only where F5 shows mass. EuroVoc alignment is URI-only (exact label matching is unreliable, T10 F4); RM labels come from the translation fallback. Open C-1: topics may be carried as document categories instead of entities; this entity form is the graph-side option.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:colorForeground>#FFFFFF</thalabus:colorForeground>
    <thalabus:colorBackground>#7B271C</thalabus:colorBackground>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Topic/topic_uri"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Topic/gnd_uri"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Topic/label_ml"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Topic/eurovoc_uri"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Topic/scheme"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/RelationshipOntology/Parlament/IS_DOCUMENTED">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>IS_DOCUMENTED</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>RelationshipOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>e00d37ac-8a97-44ba-aa92-80354b8c8542</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>IS_DOCUMENTED</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Links an entity to the Document that describes or registers it. For Affair the cardinality is one affair to zero-or-more documents (1:N when documented): one source affair keyed by business_id may be documented by several files, so do not create one Affair per file. Machine-managed edge properties (kind, created_by, created_at, stable key) are defined by T27, not by this ontology; this ontology only declares the type, and T27 owns registration, the writer, GC and ACL rules. Traversal is ACL-guarded per T27 ground rule 1.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:sourceLabels>Affair</thalabus:sourceLabels>
    <thalabus:targetLabels>Document</thalabus:targetLabels>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_08e11371a59c">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_08e11371a59c</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>DECISION_BODY</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The specific governmental body or council that issued the decision or is reviewing the matter</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>CANTONAL_COUNCIL,EXECUTIVE_COUNCIL,GOVERNMENT_COUNCIL,SPECIAL_COMMISSION</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/EntityOntology/Parlament/Affair">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Affair</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>EntityOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>3aeb81a6-e243-420a-a936-cf5de4c6da5c</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>Affair</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>A single parliamentary affair (motion, postulate, interpellation, government business, ...) as published by the Swiss Federal Assembly and mirrored in the OpenParlData corpus (affairs table, 326k rows). Identified business-wise by business_id. The instrument/kind of an affair is deliberately NOT an attribute: it is expressed via the AFFAIR_TYPE document category (T13 D3).</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:colorForeground>#FFFFFF</thalabus:colorForeground>
    <thalabus:colorBackground>#A49F34</thalabus:colorBackground>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/scope"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/submitted_on"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/type_wikidata"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/closed_on"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/source_url"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/extraction_notes"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/business_id"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/state"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/title_ml"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Person/full_name">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>77c61f41-3b37-4644-9882-4bfbc3d84f8b</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>Person</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>full_name</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>Name of the person as published in the corpus.</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/closed_on">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>3aeb81a6-e243-420a-a936-cf5de4c6da5c</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>Affair</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>closed_on</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>date</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>Date on which the affair was closed or terminated.</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_89602d90fbf9">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_89602d90fbf9</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>TAX_REFORM_IMPACT</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Documents analyzing or commenting on how proposed or enacted tax reforms affect specific sectors, businesses, or individuals.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/EntityOntology/Parlament/Canton">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Canton</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>EntityOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>9df7a738-4841-442c-8ba6-0e7ba5eda81c</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>Canton</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>A Swiss canton: the 26 member states, directly grounded in OpenParlData bodies rows with type=canton (measured: 2,411 bodies total; type distribution country 249 / canton 26 / city 162 / municipality 1974). A canton is a territory, not a parliament: its legislative body is referenced by body_id and modelled as an Organisation. Persons attach via FROM_CANTON; affairs carry their corpus slice through SCOPE categorisation, not an edge to this type.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:colorForeground>#FFFFFF</thalabus:colorForeground>
    <thalabus:colorBackground>#3A0C6C</thalabus:colorBackground>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Canton/canton_code"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Canton/body_id"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Canton/wikidata_uri"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Canton/name_ml"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/submitted_on">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>3aeb81a6-e243-420a-a936-cf5de4c6da5c</thalabus:parentId>
