    <rdfs:comment>Documents that contain formal questions or inquiries directed to a legislative or executive body regarding specific policy issues or administrative matters.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/EntityOntology/Parlament/Organisation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Organisation</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>EntityOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>1133b3a5-c3a8-4b44-b33e-48e05fcb0ae1</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>Organisation</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>A collective actor in the parliamentary corpus: parliamentary body, committee, department, party, or vote group. Sourced from the bodies table (2,411 rows), contributor roles (committees/departments), and vote group_* fields. Affairs link to organisations via HANDLED_BY and PUBLISHED_BY; persons via MEMBER_OF.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:colorForeground>#FFFFFF</thalabus:colorForeground>
    <thalabus:colorBackground>#54A9B1</thalabus:colorBackground>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Organisation/level"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Organisation/official_key"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Organisation/name_ml"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Organisation/org_kind"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_a9108c33e43d">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_a9108c33e43d</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>INVESTOR_PROPOSAL_EVALUATION</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Documents that analyze and compare bids from private investors for the purchase of public land, including financial offers, development plans, and compliance with public policy criteria.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_99557940aa15">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_99557940aa15</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>POLICE_ORGANIZATION</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Category for documents detailing the structure, composition, leadership, and operational organization of a police force, including commission formation, staffing, and station locations.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/ABOUT_TOPIC/weight">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>06198916-519a-4150-b787-d9ec8e6628d9</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>ABOUT_TOPIC</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>weight</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>Classifier confidence for this affair-topic pair as a decimal string in 0..1 (stored as string so a future float type can be introduced without changing semantics). Allows a minimum-confidence filter at read time.</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/MEMBER_OF/since">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
