    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>Canonical OpenParlData URI of the affair record. Provenance link back to the source.</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/CONTRIBUTES_TO/role_kind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>001c5720-b528-4fb6-a7ec-a1e7a02a9a6f</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>CONTRIBUTES_TO</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>role_kind</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>Role of the person towards the affair. Allowed values: author, cosign, speaker, assignee (aligned with source role_harmonized).</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_4773e2b2b99c">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_4773e2b2b99c</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>LANGUAGE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Language of the document/affair title, derived — the corpus carries no trustworthy row-level language field (T8: no original_language; docs.language is copied metadata, not detected). LoV normalised to UPPER_SNAKE of the ISO codes de/fr/it/rm. Measured title fill on affairs: de 74.9 %, fr 44.5 %, it 30.3 %, rm 0.38 % (languages sum &gt; 100 % because titles are multi-translated).</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>DE,FR,IT,RM</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Organisation/official_key">
