    <thalabus:attrValue>Geographic/administrative level. Allowed values mirror the measured bodies.type distribution: country (249), canton (26), city (162), municipality (1974).</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Canton/wikidata_uri">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>9df7a738-4841-442c-8ba6-0e7ba5eda81c</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>Canton</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>wikidata_uri</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>Alignment URI to the canton article (bodies.wikidata_id / legislative_wikidata_id); alignment hook consistent with Affair.type_wikidata.</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_b4f543bc2dc8">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_b4f543bc2dc8</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>DATA_AVAILABILITY_STATUS</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Describes the availability and reliability of data referenced in the document, including whether data is complete, outdated, or missing</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>complete,partial,outdated,missing</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_8ad4f6a378e1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_8ad4f6a378e1</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>QUESTION_TYPE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The nature of the inquiry or request (e.g., factual question, policy question, request for action)</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>factual,policy,action_request</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_d1934029aa68">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_d1934029aa68</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>GOVERNANCE_LEVEL</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Identifies the administrative or governmental level responsible for the subject matter (e.g., federal, cantonal, municipal)</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>federal,cantonal,municipal,regional</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_28d2db4c7134">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_28d2db4c7134</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>PROPERTY_DISPOSAL</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Category for documents proposing the sale or disposal of government-owned real estate assets, including justification based on strategic asset management, budget relief, or urban development goals.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_20672ad45843">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_20672ad45843</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>ADDRESSEE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The intended recipient of the document, such as a government body, official, or committee.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/RelationshipOntology/Parlament/HANDLED_BY">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>HANDLED_BY</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>RelationshipOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>c868d585-9e62-4b8f-b9a2-22acff6516c0</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>HANDLED_BY</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Committee/department routing of an affair: which organisation handles (or handled) the affair at a given stage.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:sourceLabels>Affair</thalabus:sourceLabels>
    <thalabus:targetLabels>Organisation</thalabus:targetLabels>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/HANDLED_BY/stage_kind"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_60992c2cf1f7">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_60992c2cf1f7</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>REQUEST_TYPE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The nature or type of the request made in the document (e.g., inquiry, question, petition)</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>INQUIRY,QUESTION,PETITION</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_463740a1db42">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_463740a1db42</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>STATISTICAL_DATA_PRESENT</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Indicates whether the document contains statistical data, tables, or numerical information related to the inquiry topic.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>TRUE, FALSE</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_bd9d035f0402">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_bd9d035f0402</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>AFFAIR_STATE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Lifecycle state of the affair, derived from OpenParlData events.title_harmonized (full stream 2026-10-13: 84 raw harmonized titles, 328 nonempty; affairs.state and affairs.state_name_harmonized are dead). LoV is the curated 14-value canonical normalisation of the measured enum; the import file maps every raw title onto one of these (e.g. Beantwortung -&gt; BEANTWORTET, Bereit zur Traktandierung -&gt; TRAKTANDIERT, Uberwiesen/Weisung/Zuweisung an Kommission -&gt; UEBERWIESEN, Im/Vom Parlament behandelt -&gt; BEHANDELT, Abgeschlossen -&gt; ERLEDIGT). The 14 canonical values cover ~70 % of event rows; the long-tail request/deadline vocabulary stays unmapped. Note: the former T13 seed value in Treatment does not occur in the archived corpus and was withdrawn.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>EINGEREICHT,BEANTWORTET,TRAKTANDIERT,UEBERWIESEN,BEHANDELT,ANGENOMMEN,ABGELEHNT,ABGESCHRIEBEN,ZURUECKGEZOGEN,ERLEDIGT,NICHT_ERHEBLICH,ANTRAG_ANNEHMEN,ANTRAG_ABLEHNEN,ANTRAG_UEBERWEISEN</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/state">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>3aeb81a6-e243-420a-a936-cf5de4c6da5c</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>Affair</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>state</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>Lifecycle state, harmonized from events.title_harmonized (91% coverage; state/active are dead fields). Allowed values: see AFFAIR_STATE category LoV (T13 D3).</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Canton/name_ml">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>9df7a738-4841-442c-8ba6-0e7ba5eda81c</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>Canton</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>name_ml</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>JSON object of per-language names from bodies.name_de/_fr/_it (EN also available on bodies.name_en), e.g. {"de": "Bern", "fr": "Berne", "it": "Berna"}.</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_ab6bf0a92db9">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_ab6bf0a92db9</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>ENERGY_FUNDING</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Focuses on financial aspects related to energy programs, subsidies, budget allocation, and funding mechanisms</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>SUBSIDIES,BUDGET,FUNDING,GRANTS</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_51716f5a32c6">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_51716f5a32c6</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>LEGISLATIVE_STAGE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The current stage of the legislative process for the discussed bill or proposal</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>APPROVED,FIRST_READING,REJECTED,REPORT_SUBMITTED,SECOND_READING,THIRD_READING,UNDER_REVIEW</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Organisation/name_ml">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>1133b3a5-c3a8-4b44-b33e-48e05fcb0ae1</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>Organisation</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>name_ml</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>JSON object of per-language names, e.g. {"de": "...", "fr": "...", "it": "..."}.</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_f00f10f82af5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_f00f10f82af5</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>FAMILY_SUPPORT_MEASURES</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Documents specifically addressing policies or proposals related to financial or social support for families, including child poverty alleviation, working poor support, and family income supplements.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/EntityOntology/Parlament/Person">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Person</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>EntityOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>77c61f41-3b37-4644-9882-4bfbc3d84f8b</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>Person</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>A natural person in the parliamentary corpus: a contributor (author, cosigner, speaker or assignee, 67% of contributor rows are person-typed, 85.3% affair coverage) and/or a voter (per-person votes). Persons connect to affairs via CONTRIBUTES_TO, to organisations via MEMBER_OF, and to their canton via FROM_CANTON (replacing the former canton attribute, which had no backing on the persons table).</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:colorForeground>#FFFFFF</thalabus:colorForeground>
    <thalabus:colorBackground>#C95637</thalabus:colorBackground>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Person/party"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Person/person_key"/>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Person/full_name"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_1f4596679d77">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_1f4596679d77</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>POLICE_GOVERNANCE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Category for documents describing the governance framework of the police, including oversight bodies (e.g., police commissions), decision-making processes, and reporting lines to executive or legislative bodies.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_f9f687f39fdf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_f9f687f39fdf</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>EDUCATION_POLICY</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Documents related to policies, support, or regulation of education and vocational training</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_5479d3b62be0">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_5479d3b62be0</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>AFFAIR_TYPE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Parliamentary instrument of the affair, mirroring OpenParlData type_harmonized (measured on the full affairs stream 2026-10-13: 17 values, filled on 83.1 %, top-heavy Anfrage/Interpellation/Regierungsgeschäft/Motion/Postulat ~62 % of filled). LoV values are the harmonized German labels normalised to UPPER_SNAKE (umlauts expanded: REGIERUNGSGESCHAFT, EINBUERGERUNG, ERGAENZUNGSANTRAG); the import file maps raw values onto them. Wikidata bridge on 68.2 % (type_wikidata) is kept as an affair attribute, not here. use_as_document_label candidate (C-4, pending T12).</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>ANFRAGE,INTERPELLATION,REGIERUNGSGESCHAFT,MOTION,POSTULAT,FRAGESTUNDE,WAHL,PARLAMENTARISCHE_INITIATIVE,BERICHT,VERNEHMLASSUNG,INFORMATIONSDOKUMENT,PETITION,VOLKSINITIATIVE,DIVERSES,PARLAMENTARISCHER_GENEHMIGUNGSBESCHLUSS,EINBUERGERUNG,ERGAENZUNGSANTRAG</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/Affair/title_ml">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>OntologyAttribute</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:parentId>3aeb81a6-e243-420a-a936-cf5de4c6da5c</thalabus:parentId>
    <thalabus:parentLabel>Affair</thalabus:parentLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <thalabus:attrName>title_ml</thalabus:attrName>
    <thalabus:attrType>string</thalabus:attrType>
    <thalabus:attrValue>JSON object of per-language titles, e.g. {"de": "...", "fr": "...", "it": "..."}. title_lang identifies the selected language; filename suffixes are not reliable language evidence (T8).</thalabus:attrValue>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_954a625f27f0">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_954a625f27f0</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>LEGISLATIVE_ISSUE_STATUS</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The procedural status or stage of a legislative proposal or report within the session (e.g., reported ready for debate, first reading completed)</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>ready_for_debate,first_reading_completed,discussion_started,adopted,rejected,postponed</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/RelationshipOntology/Parlament/MEMBER_OF">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>MEMBER_OF</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>RelationshipOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>0a608316-7bf4-4a1c-ac90-f02abb201fdb</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>MEMBER_OF</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Membership of a person in an organisation (party affiliation, committee seat). The classic cross-affair bridge: persons are connected through the organisations they share.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:sourceLabels>Person</thalabus:sourceLabels>
    <thalabus:targetLabels>Organisation</thalabus:targetLabels>
    <thalabus:hasAttribute rdf:resource="https://thalabus.io/ontology/OntologyAttribute/Parlament/MEMBER_OF/since"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_c68aebf967a5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_c68aebf967a5</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>SCOPE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>Parliament corpus slice of the document: generic level (federal/canton/city, normalised from bodies.type) or the concrete parliament body key used by the demo dossiers — CHE (federal assembly), 1711 (Bern city), 2939 (Thun). Extend with concrete ids (SH, GR, ...) as more feeds land; second-choice use_as_document_label candidate (C-4, pending T12).</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:lov>FEDERAL,CANTON,CITY,CHE,1711,2939</thalabus:lov>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_798a3064f86e">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_798a3064f86e</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>LEGISLATIVE_BODY</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The specific legislative or governing body that convened and made decisions</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/RelationshipOntology/Parlament/FROM_CANTON">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>FROM_CANTON</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:nodeType>RelationshipOntology</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>7e3cc446-e0d5-4689-aaaf-6dac3fb556aa</thalabus:entityId>
    <thalabus:typeLabel>FROM_CANTON</thalabus:typeLabel>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The canton a person comes from / represents (origin or constituency). Replaces the former Person.canton attribute: persons has NO canton column (measured on the persons stream: the field does not exist), so this edge is an ingestion DERIVATION — resolve the person body via persons.body_id and read bodies.canton_key, or match persons.electoral_district_*. Ingesting the persons table verbatim cannot populate it; the writer must resolve it.</rdfs:comment>
    <thalabus:sourceLabels>Person</thalabus:sourceLabels>
    <thalabus:targetLabels>Canton</thalabus:targetLabels>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_b749ef6fd123">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <thalabus:nodeType>KeywordCategory</thalabus:nodeType>
    <thalabus:entityId>keyword_cat_b749ef6fd123</thalabus:entityId>
    <rdfs:label>INQUIRY_ISSUE</rdfs:label>
    <thalabus:ontologyId>Parlament</thalabus:ontologyId>
    <rdfs:comment>The specific issue or question being raised in the document, e.g., infrastructure planning, energy capacity, or cost analysis.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://thalabus.io/ontology/KeywordCategory/keyword_cat_a3e9324d69ba">
